OL,3,GNEWSABand reforms after members lose
OL,4,Asons in crashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey perform a song written by Darren
OL,7,Fcalled Two Lost Souls, which he said
OL,8,Fcaptured the impact the boys' deaths
OL,9,Fhad on their extended family and the
OL,10,Fwider community. He described the
OL,11,Faftermath of their loss as being "like
OL,12,Fa tsunami".
